  "name": "remove-serve-legacy-flags",
  "title": "Remove hidden serve launcher compatibility flags",
  "description": "The recent serve-surface cleanup left one stale compatibility branch behind in packages/main/src/verifier/dev-cli.ts. The launcher still recognizes --web and --cli, even though the docs, help text, and user-facing prompts now only advertise lattice serve, --dev, and --port. We want to remove that hidden compatibility path so the launcher behavior matches the supported surface instead of quietly preserving legacy flags that no longer belong to the product.",
